### Create Payment (Stripe)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORD-001",
  "amount": 99.99,
  "currency": "USD",
  "customerName": "John Doe",
  "customerEmail": "john.doe@example.com",
  "customerPhone": "+919876543210",
  "description": "Test payment for order #001",
  "gatewayType": "STRIPE"
}

### Create Payment with Idempotency Key
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-idempotency-key-001

{
  "orderId": "ORD-002",
  "amount": 149.99,
  "currency": "INR",
  "customerName": "Jane Smith",
  "customerEmail": "jane@example.com",
  "customerPhone": "+919876543211"
}

### Get Payment by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}

### Get Payment by Order ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/order/ORD-001

### Get Customer Payments
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/customer/john.doe@example.com

### Retry Payment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}/retry

### Cancel Payment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}/cancel

### Gateway Info
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/gateways/info
